  "description": "Rack: Welded rear cargo rack capable of carrying passengers or extra gear\n\nThe VTUVIA SF20H is the perfect blend of power, versatility, and convenience. Equipped with a 48V 14Ah LG-certified battery featuring UL certification, this e-bike ensures safe and reliable performance with a maximum range of up to 70 miles on pedal assist.\nDesigned with a welded rear cargo rack, the SF20H is capable of carrying passengers or additional loads, supporting up to 330 lbs. Its foldable design allows you to save space when storing or transporting the bike, making it a practical companion for urban commutes, travel, or weekend adventures.\nThe SF20H features 20\" x 4\" fat tires for exceptional stability on various terrains, including gravel, sand, and snow. Its compact frame and low step-through height make it accessible for riders of all ages, while the front suspension fork enhances comfort on uneven roads.\nSafety is a priority with the UL-certified battery, ensuring peace of mind during every ride. An intuitive LCD display provides real-time updates on speed, range, and battery life, while integrated lights improve visibility during low-light conditions.",
